# Renamed source bundles retain concise required review records, while captures stay local.
!content/worldgen/source/places/**/shots/
content/worldgen/source/places/**/shots/**
!content/worldgen/source/places/**/shots/grade/
!content/worldgen/source/places/**/shots/grade/report.json
!content/worldgen/source/places/**/shots/context/
!content/worldgen/source/places/**/shots/context/report.json
